OL,3,GNEWSANew training to tackle harassment
OL,4,Ain gyms
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at council-run gyms in Bradford
OL,7,Fare set to receive training to help
OL,8,Ftackle harassment and unwanted
OL,9,Fattention directed at women while they
OL,10,Fexercise.
OL,12,FThe initiative, set up by West
OL,13,FYorkshire Police in partnership with
OL,14,FBradford Council, will focus on
OL,15,Fteaching staff to recognise and
OL,16,Fchallenge inappropriate behaviour in
OL,17,Fgyms.
OL,19,FIt builds on West Yorkshire Police's
OL,20,FJogOn campaign which launched in 2024
OL,21,Fto improve safety for women and girls
OL,22,Fexercising outdoors.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
