OL,3,GNEWSANew training to tackle harassment
OL,4,Ain gyms
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Nick Haigh said: "As we move
OL,7,Finto the winter months and more people
OL,8,Fchoose to exercise indoors, it is vital
OL,9,Fthat the same expectations apply in
OL,10,Fgyms and leisure centres."
